<!-- ============ PRIVACY ============ -->
<section class="band dark-band" id="privacy">
  <div class="container privacy-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">privacy &amp; security</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:18px">Your voice never has to leave your machine.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Switch on on-device mode and transcription runs entirely locally with Whisper — no cloud round-trip. Prefer speed? Use our managed cloud, no API key needed. No account required to start, either way.</p>
      <div class="priv-points">
        <div class="priv-point"><span class="pn">01</span><div><h3>On-device mode</h3><p>Choose local Whisper and your speech is transcribed on your machine — the audio never touches a server.</p></div></div>
        <div class="priv-point"><span class="pn">02</span><div><h3>Privacy Mode</h3><p>Flip it on and nothing is written to disk — no history rows, no archived audio. The session leaves no trace.</p></div></div>
        <div class="priv-point"><span class="pn">03</span><div><h3>Managed or your own keys</h3><p>Cloud speed runs on our managed keys out of the box — no signup for an API key. Prefer your own? Plug them in. Or switch to on-device anytime.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="priv-visual">
      <div class="toggle-row"><div class="tr-label"><b>Cloud speed</b><span>Managed — no API key needed</span></div><div class="switch"></div></div>
      <div class="toggle-row"><div class="tr-label"><b>On-device mode</b><span>Local Whisper, fully offline</span></div><div class="switch off"></div></div>
      <div class="toggle-row"><div class="tr-label"><b>Privacy Mode</b><span>Don't save history or audio</span></div><div class="switch off"></div></div>
      <div class="toggle-row"><div class="tr-label"><b>Bring your own keys</b><span>Use your own provider keys</span></div><div class="switch off"></div></div>
      <div class="priv-chip-row">
        <span class="priv-chip">No account to start</span>
        <span class="priv-chip">On-device option</span>
        <span class="priv-chip">Bring your own keys</span>
        <span class="priv-chip">Open releases</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

