<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="band container" id="faq">
  <div class="section-head center">
    <span class="eyebrow">questions</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Good to know.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Is my audio uploaded anywhere?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>It can stay entirely on your machine: turn on on-device mode and local Whisper transcribes with nothing uploaded, while Privacy Mode writes nothing to disk. By default Super Flow uses our managed cloud for speed (no API key needed) — switch to on-device, or bring your own keys, anytime.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Does it work offline?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — in on-device mode. Local Whisper transcribes with no connection. The default cloud mode needs internet, so switch to on-device for fully offline use.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Which apps does it work in?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Anywhere there's a text field — Gmail, Word, Google Docs, Slack, Discord, VS Code, Cursor, Notion, Obsidian, Linear, Figma, ChatGPT and more. It types into whatever window has focus.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">How accurate is the cleanup?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>You choose. Cleanup runs at four levels — from a raw transcript, to light touch-ups, to a standard rewrite, to a full polish that matches your style. Say “backtrack” to retract a sentence on the fly.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">What languages are supported?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Auto-detect handles your language automatically, and on-device Whisper supports dozens — including English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian and more. Pick a language, or auto, right from the recording overlay.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Is there a Mac version?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Super Flow is Windows 10 &amp; 11 today. Mac and mobile are on the roadmap — the download section has a spot to get notified.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

